W2 STEP (ii) — does the KEY isolate a single Aut-orbit block at the CFI root?
  the cell fires  ⟹  keepMin is exactly ONE Aut-block  ∧  the harvest is transitive on it
  (keepMin is a union of Aut-orbits because the key is equivariant; `rep` never merges
   across Aut-orbits because every harvested generator is a verified automorphism)
  `recordKey`'s argmin ⊆ `holKeyFast`'s argmin (`RecordKey.keepMin_pairKey_subset`).
  ROOT node only.  Aut gens: Ctx/canon, leafcap 200000 (sound, maybe incomplete).

